<section id="evidence"><div class="section-num">07 / EVIDENCE & SOURCE</div><h2>先看证据，再决定下一轮。</h2><div class="card inset measure">%%EVIDENCE%%</div><p>页面显示的 CPU 是 JavaScript 提交时间；GPU 只有在异步计时扩展可用且结果有效时才记录。没有扩展时标为未测，不用 FPS 推算 GPU 耗时。实例只有一个全屏三角形；云使用一张遮罩纹理，原始 RGBA8 数据为 3,932,160 字节；画布和驱动缓冲开销未测。</p>
<div class="columns"><div class="feature"><h3>本地实现依据</h3><ul class="point-list"><li><a href="../../starry-night-train/index.html" target="_blank">星河原版</a>：<code>scene()</code>、<code>advance()</code>、<code>train()</code>、反射坐标。</li><li><a href="../../starry-night-train/experiments/round-clouds.html" target="_blank">积云实验</a>：宏观包络、球冠明暗、分档色带的对照。</li><li>本轮 <a href="src/cloud.glsl">云 Shader</a> 实现四层遮罩平涂和运动；轮廓数据明确来自本项目已有的参考 SVG。</li><li><a href="src/runtime.js">宿主代码</a> / <a href="evidence/report.json">浏览器报告</a> / <a href="evidence/handoff-r03.json">交接记录</a></li></ul></div><div class="feature"><h3>接口与测量参考</h3><ul class="point-list"><li><a href="https://registry.khronos.org/webgl/specs/latest/1.0/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Khronos WebGL 1.0 规范</a>：Shader 编译与图形管线接口。</li><li><a href="https://registry.khronos.org/webgl/extensions/EXT_disjoint_timer_query/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">EXT_disjoint_timer_query</a>：异步 GPU 耗时与 disjoint 判定。</li><li><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/EXT_disjoint_timer_query" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">MDN 计时扩展说明</a>：与 CPU 提交时间分开记录。</li></ul></div></div></section>
